pt:{name:"Liquid Penetrant Testing",code:"LPT/PT",kind:"Surface-breaking",icon:"◉",desc:"Use penetrant entry and developer action to reveal discontinuities open to the surface.",principle:"Penetrant enters surface-breaking openings by capillary action. Controlled removal and developer application produce indications for visual interpretation.",equipment:"Compatible cleaners, penetrant, remover where applicable, developer and suitable lighting.",strength:"Useful for many nonporous materials and surface-breaking discontinuities.",limits:"Cannot reveal discontinuities that do not open to the surface; cleanliness and process control are critical."},
